# mix-of-capabilities 04×05 (2) — «what does X do?» dalla definizione letta.
# La memoria profonda teneva la definizione di «Fire blanket» (Wikipedia) e la
# domanda sulla funzione costruiva la lacuna su «blanket». La risposta e' il testo
# letto, dichiarato come tale (kb/core/function-questions.p0), e la provenienza
# segue.
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test a function question answers with the read definition and its source]
!timeout 30
> what does a fire blanket do?
<~ From what I read: A fire blanket is a safety device designed to extinguish
> where did you read that?
<~ the article «Fire blanket»

[test the covering topic wins over the one it contains]
!timeout 30
> what does a smoke detector do?
<~ senses smoke
<! don't know about detector

[test the generic verb at the end is not the object of a relation verb]
!timeout 30
> what does a heat pump do?
<! nothing I hold says
<~ heat pump
> what does a sump pump do?
<~ From what I read: A sump pump is a pump used to remove water
